   "download_with_shared_mb": 28,
   "download_with_shared_mb_why": "plus the kit swatches its GLB uses and every character and animal it casts (GLB + KTX2 copies): 15.3 / 16.0 / 16.4 MB now; the first visit's worst case, shared things come from cache after. Raised from 20 to 28 by the lead, 2026-10-12 (round 2): the river sections cast 27+ models (boat crews), and each character now carries every take it plays (S2 25.1, S3 26.1 MB with the round-2 cast). The cast is shared and cached across sections, so this is a cold first visit's worst case; phone memory (the window budget) is the binding limit, not download",
   "triangles_k": 130,
   "triangles_k_why": "drawn triangles: 119.5k / 107.2k / 109.6k now; the web-scene skill's budget (about 38 per m2 at full detail, 130k for a 74 x 46 m section)",
   "collider_triangles_k": 5,
   "collider_triangles_k_why": "collider-only (hidden__) meshes: 0.6-1.2k now; invisible walls, trunks and ramps are boxes, not meshes",
   "texture_own_mb": 24,
   "texture_own_mb_why": "its panels and tree cards on the GPU (KTX2): 7.8 / 18.3 / 15.0 MB now; 69 MB for the gate as webp, so a section that ships cards without running tools/ktx2.mjs fails here",
   "people": null,
